# Secrets (service role, Firebase) belong in .env.local locally and in the
# Vercel project settings for production -- never commit them here.

# --- Supabase (product catalog + image storage) --------------------------
# URL and anon key are safe for the browser; the catalog table is protected
# by row-level security (public read only).
